{"sessionId":"L1-S03","number":3,"sessionTitle":"Stop, Wait, Go!","title":"The Bread Cart","titleCard":{"text":"Episode 3. The Bread Cart.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/title.ogg","dur":3.123,"env":"000irf20ppmqrfyyuxdd955c8ovwuttrsrstrj000000000006bborsqnemzzg48uzzxr3f60gdtwvurod208d40000000","words":[["Episode",0.1,1.0],["3.",1.0,1.26],["The",1.64,1.98],["Bread",1.98,2.47],["Cart.",2.47,2.89]],"voice":"narrator"},"previously":{"text":"Your robot got wheels and found the first light. The light pointed to the bakery…","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/prev.ogg","dur":6.427,"env":"000oyzyvvsfjk44ga00g7gsqppppqoool80000000000hvvpnuzzzy4myul4c0hzxsh7bctzxvrtuspongcautuj56jxpqssb27j35zztpine5desrsqqoqood04900000000000vqzzxtoc0c049gzzzzs2grwk08h3fe9v60bzzzn09b7qoooom90000000","words":[["Last",0.11,0.61],["time...",0.61,1.12],["Your",1.48,1.76],["robot",1.76,2.09],["got",2.09,2.32],["wheels",2.32,2.7],["and",2.7,2.93],["found",2.93,3.26],["the",3.26,3.49],["first",3.49,3.82],["light.",3.82,4.15],["The",4.52,4.73],["light",4.73,5.04],["pointed",5.04,5.45],["to",5.45,5.61],["the",5.61,5.83],["bakery…",5.83,6.18]],"voice":"narrator"},"scenes":[{"setting":"Bakery Lane: a busy street going down the hill. Mr Okafor’s bakery, warm smells drawn as swirls.","action":"The team follows the light’s arrow. A bread cart rolls across the street.","seconds":30,"lines":[{"i":0,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"The light points into the bakery! Let’s go!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/0.ogg","dur":2.754,"env":"00xsntzzud5569rnomjdnpdmehctcuj98zzr769nqstnlg600000000nus966ppe204xzzxzvon83000000","words":[["The",0.08,0.27],["light",0.27,0.53],["points",0.53,0.84],["into",0.84,1.07],["the",1.07,1.26],["bakery!",1.26,1.56],["Let’s",1.85,2.27],["go!",2.27,2.54]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":1,"who":"guest","guestName":"Mr Okafor, the baker","text":"Careful, little ones! My bread cart crosses here every morning!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/1.ogg","dur":4.401,"env":"00497lfg523rvsjf4000004imxvqmppoklokkjliha7e40000000000isjhgfeetrolkfd40047aunf300459topjbigppfdb9czwwutpc7mnicorsqrposqoiolib700000","words":[["Careful,",0.1,0.65],["little",0.65,1.13],["ones!",1.13,1.48],["My",1.85,2.03],["bread",2.03,2.37],["cart",2.37,2.66],["crosses",2.66,3.11],["here",3.11,3.4],["every",3.4,3.74],["morning!",3.74,4.19]],"voice":"okafor"}]},{"setting":"Bakery Lane. The robot rolls towards the cart’s path.","action":"The robot rolls straight on. Just in time the cart stops. Crumbs fly; nobody is hurt; a loaf lands on Bolt’s head.","seconds":35,"lines":[{"i":2,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"Stop! The robot didn’t wait!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/2.ogg","dur":2.797,"env":"000000007eoo9nzyzn0000000000000000000000000007rszzzusztkevzxzzt9mvwvsgc7202000000000","words":[["Stop!",0.24,1.05],["The",1.4,1.63],["robot",1.63,1.97],["didn’t",1.97,2.3],["wait!",2.3,2.58]],"voice":"amara"},{"i":3,"who":"bolt","guestName":null,"text":"Beep-woof?","direction":"Wearing a loaf like a hat.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/3.ogg","dur":1.386,"env":"0rtvr8ovuh02200222szzzs8cca854320220000000","words":[["Beep",0.06,0.33],["woof?",0.41,1.15]],"voice":"bolt"},{"i":4,"who":"lucia","guestName":null,"text":"Our robot does every step right away. It needs a step that says: wait.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/4.ogg","dur":5.19,"env":"004sstttouxwvi9otb00nzxomvxqgbyzxiqssq2iwqm2029pxuusawnkwqqrqqqqpna0000000000000aqb0hoqqqqre0odkjrqprqm0gpqoj903303mljkb0ktqrsrarllpgpf8qolnllib20if70000000","words":[["Our",0.1,0.33],["robot",0.33,0.67],["does",0.67,0.96],["every",0.96,1.3],["step",1.3,1.59],["right",1.59,1.92],["away.",1.92,2.21],["It",2.7,2.93],["needs",2.93,3.36],["a",3.36,3.53],["step",3.53,3.89],["that",3.89,4.25],["says:",4.25,4.62],["wait.",4.62,4.98]],"voice":"lucia"}]},{"setting":"Kerb at the side of the street.","action":"Spark draws three cards in the air: GO, WAIT, GO. Then shuffles them: GO, GO, WAIT — and the cartoon robot bumps the cart.","seconds":45,"lines":[{"i":5,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Go one. Wait. Then go again!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/5.ogg","dur":2.588,"env":"00oxwsklopmke98300000000swppqjd2ckc20000000006szytrhdljtzwwte7svpllejlh3000000","words":[["Go",0.07,0.27],["one.",0.27,0.53],["Wait.",0.82,1.19],["Then",1.51,1.82],["go",1.82,2.01],["again!",2.01,2.37]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":6,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"What if we mix the cards up? Go, go, then wait?","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/6.ogg","dur":2.9,"env":"00tvtukrh6psjbfpqb38l82wb387nwrqrp98g46ttsn4520000004tsoga6trqomfewyqinonpzyvk786000000","words":[["What",0.08,0.33],["if",0.33,0.49],["we",0.49,0.65],["mix",0.65,0.85],["the",0.85,1.06],["cards",1.06,1.36],["up?",1.36,1.51],["Go,",1.76,1.94],["go,",1.94,2.12],["then",2.12,2.41],["wait?",2.41,2.69]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":7,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"Then it waits AFTER the crash. The order is important!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/7.ogg","dur":3.981,"env":"00000000jzzxvtqjuxth2cgntrob3glsqss5acstoqmha8dklie92000000000000000000003tvnkzzxzoywxuplpuwr54ztmjeknoli500000000000000","words":[["Then",0.29,0.53],["it",0.53,0.69],["waits",0.69,0.98],["AFTER",0.98,1.27],["the",1.27,1.47],["crash.",1.47,1.76],["The",2.47,2.66],["order",2.66,2.94],["is",2.94,3.09],["important!",3.09,3.55]],"voice":"amara"},{"i":8,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"Which card comes first? You choose!","direction":"Pause for answers.","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/8.ogg","dur":2.51,"env":"00sr2ic2c9yzzwj5687qpflnqpb28xurifmia7400000000nrf3kohyzusolid6pxom730000000","words":[["Which",0.08,0.39],["card",0.39,0.66],["comes",0.66,0.97],["first?",0.97,1.29],["You",1.58,1.84],["choose!",1.84,2.29]],"voice":"spark"}]},{"setting":"Bakery Lane, second try.","action":"Robot hops once, waits as the cart rolls by, then hops to the bakery door. Mr Okafor claps with floury hands.","seconds":30,"lines":[{"i":9,"who":"guest","guestName":"Mr Okafor, the baker","text":"What a polite robot!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/9.ogg","dur":1.357,"env":"0009orfod00bmpqkkd300bmsmb86dmfb004000000","words":[["What",0.11,0.37],["a",0.37,0.49],["polite",0.49,0.84],["robot!",0.84,1.15]],"voice":"okafor"},{"i":10,"who":"myrobot","guestName":null,"text":"Beep! Good morning!","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/10.ogg","dur":1.296,"env":"003jwso800000000003tskcktwwunmkb3000000","words":[["Beep!",0.1,0.25],["Good",0.63,0.81],["morning!",0.81,1.08]],"voice":"myrobot"}]},{"setting":"Inside the bakery. Shelves of bread from around the world: flatbread, round loaves, buns.","action":"The clock light glows from inside a tall stack of bread baskets. People bustle everywhere. A small girl hides behind her dad’s leg, afraid of the robot.","seconds":25,"lines":[{"i":11,"who":"spark","guestName":null,"text":"There’s the light! But the bakery is so busy…","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/11.ogg","dur":3.893,"env":"02vyuuuunlq6lzyqmzzxrd8300c600000000yute45d3000000003ett97zzzzd898rolqrof5200000000ajcfb003qrmmvqcd8ezwsklklh93000000","words":[["There’s",0.07,0.42],["the",0.42,0.63],["light!",0.63,0.93],["But",1.2,1.59],["the",1.59,1.97],["bakery",1.97,2.62],["is",2.62,2.91],["so",2.91,3.21],["busy…",3.21,3.68]],"voice":"spark"},{"i":12,"who":"amara","guestName":null,"text":"And that little girl looks scared of our robot.","direction":null,"file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/12.ogg","dur":2.704,"env":"00000000uvzzzpjovzvixzmeyvrtuvuwvn3elmg3hvvvspsujptoppkltqtlalnoma000000000000000","words":[["And",0.08,0.28],["that",0.28,0.53],["little",0.53,0.87],["girl",0.87,1.12],["looks",1.12,1.41],["scared",1.41,1.75],["of",1.75,1.91],["our",1.91,2.11],["robot.",2.11,2.4]],"voice":"amara"}]}],"cliffhanger":{"text":"The second light is inside the crowded bakery — and a little girl is frightened of the robot. How can people know what a robot will do?","file":"/kids/audio/l1/L1-S03/ne